        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"66691747-76ac-4c71-b0c6-3d5d752bf30b\",\"review_text\":\"podcast often stop suddenly\"},{\"review_id\":\"a02896cb-9b92-4c67-9252-4b006bed3ef5\",\"review_text\":\"Bed aap west time\"},{\"review_id\":\"58c4282b-f0a9-4ae4-a7f0-6e6f30d6bafd\",\"review_text\":\"On mobile if you make a Playlist it automatically adds other songs to it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2793cbb0-d7ae-43fc-8724-824f503e54b3\",\"review_text\":\"It used to be good a while back but now it's too petty. Gonna delete it\"},{\"review_id\":\"52d241f6-4ff3-4a1f-a6d1-31e090475629\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c53c9c8e-9a82-42d1-bebb-74b50bd9a4a3\",\"review_text\":\"👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👊\"},{\"review_id\":\"f7218ea9-a26a-4184-a839-2b42c37752fc\",\"review_text\":\"REALLY EVERYTHING EVEN SKIP SONGS YOU NEED MONEY A BIG L SPOTIFY\"},{\"review_id\":\"616fa96d-6e23-4527-b4a4-71d669eaac25\",\"review_text\":\"Pathetic Updates and the application has become worst. All my saved music got removed. Oke Cannot back the song. Will uninstall the application now.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e04b40b8-4ac0-4058-aa91-89986d53586a\",\"review_text\":\"Easy to use 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍🏼👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"6e0d2edc-2c07-4d1b-8d77-ac2fb607c141\",\"review_text\":\"Poor playlists, repeating the same songs over and over, Premium has limited options, car mode and regular mode are skewed. Just tired of Spotify..we need a better streaming service that. Spotify and Pandora.\"}]}"
